---@field id string
---@field job_id string|distilled.Null Warehouse import or materialization job associated with the run, if any.
---@field account_segment posthog.custom_property_definitions.SyncSegmentEnum|distilled.Null Account segment processed by this run. Person and group property runs return null. * `tracked` - tracked * `ignored` - ignored
---@field sync_phase posthog.custom_property_definitions.SyncPhaseEnum|distilled.Null Current account sync phase. Person and group property runs return null. * `staging` - staging * `dispatching` - dispatching * `syncing` - syncing * `completed` - completed
---@field attempt number|distilled.Null Latest Temporal activity attempt for the current account sync phase.
